<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Partial CLIP is Enough: 
<br class="ltx_break"><img src="2506.22032v1/chimela.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:20/20;" width="20" height="20" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"> Chimera-Seg for Zero-shot Semantic Segmentation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jialei Chen<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">*</sup>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Xu Zheng<sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup">†</sup>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Danda Pani Paudel
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
