<td id="S4.T12.5.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:20.0pt;padding-right:20.0pt;">  33.9</td>
<td id="S4.T12.5.1.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:20.0pt;padding-right:20.0pt;">  33.3</td></tr>
